 of mustard and smetana (heavy sour cream). It is named after one of the members of the Stroganov family. Since its appearance in the 19th century, it has become popular around the world, with considerable variation from the original recipe. Mushrooms are common in many variants."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-beef-stroganoff"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beef_Stroganoff"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["French cuisine","cuisine/french-cuisine"],["New Caledonian cuisine","cuisine/new-caledonian-cuisine"],["Russian cuisine","cuisine/russian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":5,"links":[["Beef","ingredient/beef"],["Smetana","ingredient/smetana"],["Smetana (dairy product)","ingredient/smetana-dairy-product"],["Sour cream","ingredient/sour-cream"],["Tomato paste","ingredient/tomato-paste"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Pardon Your French","ref":"site/pardonyourfrench-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"pardonyourfrench.com","note":"Audrey Le Goff, a French cook, shares classic and regional French home recipes.","url":"https://pardonyourfrench.com","suggested":true},{"name":"La Cuisine de Géraldine","ref":"site/lacuisinedegeraldine-fr","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"lacuisinedegeraldine.fr","note":"French home cooking blog by Géraldine Leverd, also author of The New French Kitchen.","url":"https://lacuisinedegeraldine.fr/en/about-us","suggested":true},{"name":"New Caledonia Tourism: Kanak cooking","ref":"site/newcaledonia-travel","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"newcaledonia.travel","note":"Official tourism board overview of Kanak food, including bougna cooked in an earth oven.","url":"https://www.newcaledonia.travel/nz/gastronomy-wine/gastronomy/kanak-cooking","suggested":true},{"name":"Olga's Flavor Factory","ref":"site/olgasflavorfactory-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"olgasflavorfactory.com","note":"Russian-born home cook Olga's blog, with a dedicated Ru