. The salad's popularity in the USSR (and nowadays in the post-Soviet states) has led to the emergence of a wide variety of recipes."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-mimosa-salad"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mimosa_salad"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Belarusian cuisine","cuisine/belarusian-cuisine"],["Russian cuisine","cuisine/russian-cuisine"],["Soviet cuisine","cuisine/soviet-cuisine"],["Ukrainian cuisine","cuisine/ukrainian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":10,"links":[["Butter","ingredient/butter"],["Canned fish","ingredient/canned-fish"],["Canning","ingredient/canning"],["Cheese","ingredient/cheese"],["Egg","ingredient/egg"],["Grated cheese","ingredient/grated-cheese"],["Mayonnaise","ingredient/mayonnaise"],["Onion","ingredient/onion"],["Potato","ingredient/potato"],["Thunnus","ingredient/thunnus"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Olga's Flavor Factory","ref":"site/olgasflavorfactory-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"olgasflavorfactory.com","note":"Russian-born home cook Olga's blog, with a dedicated Russian recipes category.","url":"https://www.olgasflavorfactory.com/category/russianrecipes/","suggested":true},{"name":"Savas Kitchen: Ukrainian recipes","ref":"site/savaskitchen-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"savaskitchen.com","note":"Ukrainian-born home cook Nataliia Savas's section of family Ukrainian recipes.","url":"https://savaskitchen.com/category/ukrainian-recipes","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Belarusian cuisine","links":[["Angel wings","dish/angel-wings"],["Aspic","dish/aspic"],["Baba (cake)","dish/baba-cake"],["Borscht","dish/borscht"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Cold beet soup","dish/cold-beet-soup"],["Gugelhupf","dish/gugelhupf"],["Kalduny","dish/kalduny"],["Kasha","dish/kasha"],["Krupnik (soup)","dish/krupnik-soup"],["Medovukha","dish/medovukha"],["Paska (bread)","dish/paska-bread"],["Potato pancake","dish/potato-pancake"],["Šakoti